<title>POLAND: BWR Q1 net falls to PLN 0.6 mln.</title>
<headline>BWR Q1 net falls to PLN 0.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BWR SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     0.95    vs   1.97</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 0.94    vs   1.97</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.55    vs   1.97</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   26.78    vs  19.52</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	19.50    vs  14.08</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   2.84    vs   2.42</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.45    vs   0.46</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.94    vs   1.97</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01    vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
